{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plunder Maps is about two things: Drawing a treasure map for your buried chests, and plundering chests using treasure maps from other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First you bury your treasure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238450/extras/dig.gif?t=1745787536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then you draw a treasure map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238450/extras/draw.gif?t=1745787536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And finally you play a map <strong>drawn by another player!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238450/extras/plunder.gif?t=1745787536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomly generated islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Async multiplayer - You upload your maps, other people get to play them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online multiplayer to bury and plunder treasure with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete creative freedom in your treasure map. Go wild!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3238450?t=1745787536","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3238450?t=1745787536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238450/98780829cbd5b3ab8fadb1b7473560f43d3d9b1f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745787536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238450/98780829cbd5b3ab8fadb1b7473560f43d3d9b1f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745787536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plunder Maps is about two things: Drawing a treasure map for your buried chests, and plundering chests using treasure maps from other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First you bury your treasure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238450/extras/dig.gif?t=1745787536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then you draw a treasure map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238450/extras/draw.gif?t=1745787536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And finally you play a map <strong>drawn by another player!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238450/extras/plunder.gif?t=1745787536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomly generated islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Async multiplayer - You upload your maps, other people get to play them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online multiplayer to bury and plunder treasure with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete creative freedom in your treasure map. Go wild!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Voskip"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image